Howard Hinnant's date/tz library, MIT licensed (LICENSE.txt).

Source: Ubuntu noble source package howardhinnant-date 3.0.1+ds
(howardhinnant-date_3.0.1+ds.orig.tar.xz), files copied unmodified except:
- include/date/ptz.h: time_zone::name() qualifies `date::hh_mm_ss`, which is
  ambiguous with std::chrono::hh_mm_ss under C++20 (as later upstream does).

Only built when the standard library lacks the C++20 time-zone database
(Apple libc++); see MINERA_PORTABLE_TZDB in CMakeLists.txt. include/date/ios.h
is needed by src/tz.cpp on every Apple platform.
